    <string name="key_loss_ack">I understand and have noted it</string>
    <string name="key_loss_body">There is no backup. Without this key you cannot issue or renew licenses for apps built with its public key; a new key means rebuilding and redistributing every VELTRIX OS app. Do not remove the screen lock (Android would destroy the key). Write this down somewhere safe.</string>
